      "originalText": "Cloudflare  \u2014  ONE ORIGIN,  THREE ROUTES\n/api/*  -> FastAPI        /v/*  -> FastAPI (OG share pages)        /*  -> static SPA bundle\nno CORS \u00b7 no cross-site cookies \u00b7 WAF \u00b7 CDN caches R2 media \u00b7 do NOT buffer SSE",
