        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 438272955,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t899881441",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 206.75,
      "y": 1890.0,
      "width": 346.5,
      "height": 280.0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "index": "a00057",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "THE SSE LANDMINE\n\nLISTEN is CONNECTION-scoped. It cannot be\nmultiplexed over a pool.\n\nWRONG: one PG connection per watching tab\n       -> 300 viewers exhausts Postgres\n       -> the whole API goes down\n\nRIGHT: ONE dedicated asyncpg connection per\n       replica -> dict[job_id, set[Queue]]\n       -> unbounded subscribers, 1 connection\n\n+ payload cap 8000B  -> send ids, not objects\n+ CF idle timeout    -> ': ping' every 20s\n+ NOTIFY isn't durable -> keep a 5s poll",
      "rawText": "THE SSE LANDMINE\n\nLISTEN is CONNECTION-scoped. It cannot be\nmultiplexed over a pool.\n\nWRONG: one PG connection per watching tab\n       -> 300 viewers exhausts Postgres\n       -> the whole API goes down\n\nRIGHT: ONE dedicated asyncpg connection per\n       replica -> dict[job_id, set[Queue]]\n       -> unbounded subscribers, 1 connection\n\n+ payload cap 8000B  -> send ids, not objects\n+ CF idle timeout    -> ': ping' every 20s\n+ NOTIFY isn't durable -> keep a 5s poll",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r168863251",
      "originalText": "THE SSE LANDMINE\n\nLISTEN is CONNECTION-scoped. It cannot be\nmultiplexed over a pool.\n\nWRONG: one PG connection per watching tab\n       -> 300 viewers exhausts Postgres\n       -> the whole API goes down\n\nRIGHT: ONE dedicated asyncpg connection per\n       replica -> dict[job_id, set[Queue]]\n       -> unbounded subscribers, 1 connection\n\n+ payload cap 8000B  -> send ids, not objects\n+ CF idle timeout    -> ': ping' every 20s\n+ NOTIFY isn't durable -> keep a 5s poll",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
